// The bundled STARTER project (R12): the repo root is no longer itself a
// project — `cargo run` from the root shows the launcher, and this folder is
// the starter content seeded into new projects (and packed into release
// tarballs). Open it directly in dev with `NEO_PROJECT=starter cargo run`.
//
// `level` is the level the editor is on. It is written as you move between
// levels, so this file changes when you do — that is the point of it being
// here rather than in a second, per-machine file.
(
    version: 1,
    name: "neo-starter",
    engine_version: "0.3.0",
    level: Some("assets/levels/terrain_physics_water_demo.ron"),
)
